// Round steam gauge. The dial face (case ring, ticks, numerals, legend) never changes, so it is painted once into a cached layer per canvas;
// each refresh only stamps that layer and draws the window and needles, and nothing at all is redrawn (or re-uploaded to the GPU) while the
